  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR Moldova - Strengthening the Protection and Resilience of Vulnerable Refugees through Targeted Cash-Based Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding is provided to deliver multi-purpose cash assistance (MPCA) Ukrainian vulnerable refugees in Moldova, helping them meet essential needs such as food, rent, and healthcare. Beneficiaries are selected based on legal status and vulnerability, including older persons, single parents, and individuals with disabilities. Assistance is delivered via prepaid cards and coordinated through a shared data platform to ensure transparency and avoid duplication. The programme promotes dignity, protection, and inclusion, while supporting Moldova&#x2019;s efforts to integrate refugees into national systems.</narrative>
  </description>
